  ('fox-costume-in-motion', 'fox-costume-in-motion:discussion:18', 'The small accessories deserve their own close-up.'),
  ('fox-costume-in-motion', 'fox-costume-in-motion:discussion:19', 'This would be a fun reference for a fox-themed mood board.'),
